#: addons/facing/FacingWizardPopup.kv:102
msgid ""
"Measure your stock and pick where X0 Y0 sits—the point you touched off when "
"setting work zero. Width runs along X and length along Y from that origin. "
"Margins pad the outline outward so facing and probing keep a safe distance "
"from the edges. Extra depth removes a bit more material downward on top of "
"the facing depth. Clearance height is how high the spindle travels between "
"moves. If you enable Z grid probing on the Z probe grid tab, the machine "
"checks the surface first; after you swap to your facing tool, Z zero is "
"aligned to the highest spot the probe found."
msgstr ""

