"Roughing clears material in layers using stepover, depth per pass, and total "
"rough depth (combine with Extra depth on Stock if you need more Z). Turn on "
"Finish for a light cleanup pass at the end. Pattern picks raster (Along X or "
"Along Y) or an outside-in spiral."
