"Turn on Include Z grid probe with the checkbox below; layout matches the "
"origin from the Stock tab. The machine taps the surface on a grid to map "
"height. Probe Z travel must stay negative so the probe searches downward. "
"Grid inset pulls probe points slightly inside the gray stock outline (not "
"inside the dashed margin ring). After probing and loading your facing tool, "
"Z zero is adjusted so the tallest measured spot is treated as the top "
"surface for facing."
